Package: R_fish_silhouette_animation
Title: two scripts to produce animation of the fish silouhettes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Felix", "Guillaud", , "felix.guillaud.work@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: from the raw data of MATLAB and EthoVisionXt, two customized scripts are used to better visualize fish kinematics during the fast start (escape response) and during natural behaviour in artificial contidions. processing can take time considering the rendering of animation.
